{
  "$comment": "Shared by every driver. Each producer encrypts these; each consumer checks every producer's output against them. Large:Value is 3000 bytes, which formats to 4049 characters - inside the default 4096-character limit. files are what each producer writes to the release's secrets folder, one file per secret, for FilePerSecretCache: a file holds plaintext (or plaintextOf a secret's) encrypted for its own name, or is empty, or is a copy of another file; expect is what every consumer must see - the value, missing (decrypts to 0), or refused (fails authentication). missingFiles are names no file can answer.",
  "keyVersion": 3,
  "secrets": [
    {
      "identifier": "Identifier0",
      "plaintext": "kubernetes=helm;postgres-replica+kafka/zookeeper;terraform~ansible:nginx|envoy@istio#prometheus,grafana!redis(sentinel)[cluster]{etcd}*rabbitmq^elasticsearch%kibana$logstash&fluentd;cassandra.spark-hadoop_flink;graphql<grpc>websocket?webassembly'typescript\"rust`golang;docker-compose=podman"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "Identifier1",
      "plaintext": "k-0123456789abcdef"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "Empty:Value",
      "plaintext": ""
    },
    {
      "identifier": "Unicode:Value",
      "plaintext": "pässwörd · 日本語 · 🔐"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "Pipeline:Secret",
      "plaintext": "readable under any ASCII case of its key",
      "alsoReadAs": [
        "PIPELINE:SECRET",
        "pipeline:secret"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "Café:Name",
      "plaintext": "bound to its non-ASCII key exactly",
      "mustNotReadAs": [
        "CAFÉ:NAME"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "Large:Value",
      "plaintext": ""
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "Db-Password",
      "plaintext": "k-0123456789abcdef",
      "trailingNewline": true,
      "expect": "value"
    },
    {
      "name": "unicode.value",
      "plaintext": "pässwörd · 日本語 · 🔐",
      "expect": "value"
    },
    {
      "name": "Large_Value",
      "plaintextOf": "Large:Value",
      "expect": "value"
    },
    {
      "name": "Empty-File",
      "empty": true,
      "expect": "missing"
    },
    {
      "name": "Copied-Value",
      "copyOf": "Db-Password",
      "expect": "refused"
    },
    {
      "name": ".hidden",
      "plaintext": "never read: a name starting with '.' is no secret's",
      "expect": "missing"
    }
  ],
  "missingFiles": [
    "Not-There",
    "ConnectionStrings:Admin",
    "../release.json"
  ],
  "pipeline": {
    "$comment": "Run through each port's real SecretPipelineWriter over an in-memory store. store maps each store name to its value's exact text, handed to the writer as UTF-8 (prod/app is a JSON object, so its keys read as prod/app#key). secrets are what the main writer pulls: name is what it is given, fileName what it must write it as ('/' and '#' become '__') and the name its value is bound to, plaintext what it must decrypt to, and alsoReadAs other names JsonSecretsFileReadOnlyCache must answer with it (names match ignoring ASCII case). missing are names a second writer pulls that the store holds no value for: its pull fails as missing and keeps nothing, so its JSON is {}. refused are name lists each writer constructor must refuse. missingLookups and invalidLookups must read as missing from secrets.json: the first are valid names the file doesn't hold, the second names that can't be a secret's ('ı' folds onto 'I' ignoring case, and must not match prod__api-key).",
    "store": {
      "prod/app": "{\"nested\": {\"port\": 1, \"Password\": \"nested, never read\"}, \"password\": \"s3cr3t-lower\", \"Password\": \"S3CR3T-UPPER\", \"port\": 5432, \"ratio\": 2.50, \"enabled\": true, \"escaped\": \"line one\\nline two \\u00e9 \\\"quoted\\\" \\/\", \"greeting\": \"grüße · 日本語 · 🔐\", \"empty\": \"\", \"nothing\": null, \"list\": [1, 2]}",
      "prod/api-key": "k-0123456789abcdef",
      "Prod/Db": "upper-case store name",
      "prod/db": "lower-case store name",
      "certs/unicode": "pässwörd · 日本語 · 🔐",
      "brace": "{not json",
      "blank": ""
    },
    "secrets": [
      {
        "name": "prod/app",
        "fileName": "prod__app",
        "plaintext": "{\"nested\": {\"port\": 1, \"Password\": \"nested, never read\"}, \"password\": \"s3cr3t-lower\", \"Password\": \"S3CR3T-UPPER\", \"port\": 5432, \"ratio\": 2.50, \"enabled\": true, \"escaped\": \"line one\\nline two \\u00e9 \\\"quoted\\\" \\/\", \"greeting\": \"grüße · 日本語 · 🔐\", \"empty\": \"\", \"nothing\": null, \"list\": [1, 2]}"
      },
      {
        "name": "prod/app#Password",
        "fileName": "prod__app__Password",
        "plaintext": "S3CR3T-UPPER",
        "alsoReadAs": [
          "PROD__APP__PASSWORD",
          "prod__app__password"
        ]
      },
      {
